WEBVTT

00:02.045 --> 00:03.421
[Narrator] Previously on lost:

00:03.504 --> 00:07.383
This is not your island.
This is our island.

00:07.467 --> 00:12.222
[Locke] They've attacked us, sabotaged
us, abducted us, murdered us.

00:12.305 --> 00:16.184
We're not the only people
on this island, and we all know it.

00:16.267 --> 00:19.062
[Ana Lucia] They came the first night,
took three of us.

00:19.145 --> 00:22.482
Then they came back
and took nine more.

00:22.565 --> 00:25.401
They're smart and they're animals.

00:25.485 --> 00:27.695
You're coming with us.

00:32.075 --> 00:34.410
[Birds chirping]

00:43.920 --> 00:47.298
