38:14.084 --> 38:17.004
It's pretty much about everything.

38:19.256 --> 38:25.179
Do you know about my...
About my ex—wife?

38:28.224 --> 38:33.103
Yes, Jack. We know all about her.

38:36.315 --> 38:39.276
What would you like to find out?

38:44.114 --> 38:45.866
[Man] Get ready for the lockdown.

38:45.950 --> 38:49.161
Shephard. Someone posted your ball.

39:04.134 --> 39:07.846
How'd you...?
— your dad told me you were here.

39:12.184 --> 39:14.603
I called you a cab.

39:14.687 --> 39:18.691
So, goodbye.

39:34.873 --> 39:37.918
Sarah. — what?

39:40.504 --> 39:43.173
What difference does it make?
— It just does.

39:43.257 --> 39:48.554
I wanna know. I need to know who he is.

39:48.637 --> 39:52.433
It doesn't matter who he is.
It just matters who you're not.

39:58.022 --> 40:03.944
Jack, your father,
when he called me,

40:04.028 --> 40:07.865
to help you,

40:07.948 --> 40:11.535
he was so drunk
I could hardly understand him.

40:19.543 --> 40:22.046
Look at the bright side.

40:23.547 --> 40:25.924
Now you have something to fix.

40:39.021 --> 40:40.814
[Juliet] Jack.

40:42.024 --> 40:46.820
Jack, what would you like to find out?

40:51.909 --> 40:53.911
Is she...?

40:56.080 --> 40:58.248
Is she happy?

41:00.376 --> 41:05.214
Yes, Jack, she's very happy.

41:18.018 --> 41:21.355
Now, I'd like to bring you
some food and water.

41:21.438 --> 41:25.943
But this time I need to know
that you'll behave.

41:26.026 --> 41:28.529
Can I trust you, Jack?

41:35.369 --> 41:39.540
Put your back against the wall, please.

42:12.197 --> 42:14.616
Good work, Juliet.

42:17.202 --> 42:20.205
Thank you, Ben.
